  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Viridon Path 15, LLC, (&#8220;Viridon Path 15&#8221; or the &#8220;Company&#8221;) a Delaware limited liability company, is a wholly owned subsidiary of Viridon Holdings Path 15, LLC (&#8220;Holdings Path 15&#8221;). Holdings Path 15 is a Delaware limited liability company. The members of Holdings Path 15 are Path 15 Funding, LLC, Path 15 Funding KBT, LLC, and Path 15 Transmission, LLC (&#8220;Transco Path 15&#8221;), all Delaware limited liability companies; Path 15 Funding, LLC and Path 15 Funding KBT, LLC are wholly owned subsidiaries of Transco Path 15. Transco Path 15 is a wholly owned subsidiary of Viridon Transmission Company, LLC (&#8220;Viridon&#8221;). Previously, Path 15 Transco was a wholly owned subsidiary of Duke American Transmission Company, LLC (&#8220;DATC&#8221;), a limited liability company and a multi-project joint venture between Duke Energy and American Transmission Company. In March 2025, Viridon acquired 100% of Path 15 Transco.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:5pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.84pt"&gt;Refer subsection of footnote 2 - "Organization and Purpose".&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="f-11" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:10pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.84pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
